            <ArticleTitle>[Consensus on asthma diagnosis and treatment in children and adults].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>251-77</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Asthma is a chronic airway disease that is a growing problem of public health. The current consensus is based on the Global Initiative for Asthma (GINA) and other guidelines for asthma, and adapted for Lithuania. This Consensus provides physicians with recommendations for asthma management in children and adults.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
